{%- comment -%}
  Renders one curated product card in montibello-product-range.liquid's grid.
  Rendered via `{% content_for 'blocks' %}` in the parent section — NOT via
  a manual `for block in section.blocks` + direct `block.settings.*` read.

  That manual-read pattern is what shipped originally and was the actual
  root cause of the "Catálogo completo disponible próximamente" fallback
  showing instead of any cards: this block type is declared as a file
  under blocks/ (a theme block), and theme blocks only get resolved for
  merchant/editor pathways when Shopify is asked to render them via
  content_for — enumerating them from `section.blocks` without ever
  content_for'ing them does not have a reliable resolved `.settings`
  payload. `content_for 'blocks'` is Shopify's documented mechanism for a
  variable-length, merchant-ordered list of theme blocks and needs no
  literal/static id (unlike the singular `content_for 'block', id: ...`,
  which is for one fixed static block only).

  The product itself is looked up via `all_products[block.settings.product_handle]`
  rather than a `type: "product"` block setting. That resource-reference
  setting type cannot actually be hand-authored in a JSON template — none
  of a raw GID, a numeric ID (rejected outright: "Setting 'product' must be
  a string"), or a `shopify://products/<handle>` URL resolves to a real
  product object; `block.settings.product` came back blank in all three
  cases, live-verified on staging. `all_products[handle]` is a plain text
  setting plus a documented Liquid lookup that resolves regardless of
  product status (same guarantee the old `type: "product"` setting was
  chosen for), and is trivially JSON-authorable.

  `card_image` (optional): the filename of a normalized derived card
  packshot in assets/ (e.g. "under-monodose-15vol-card.webp"), generated by
  local-assets/generated/product-cards/ — see that folder's source images
  and scripts/shopify's normalization notes. Real product photos vary
  wildly in baked-in background/whitespace/scale (some are 4000x4000
  studio renders with the product filling under half the canvas; others
  are screenshots with a visible white background), which looked broken
  once every card in a grid shared one fixed frame + object-fit: contain.
  The derived asset is a fixed 1200x1600 canvas, product cropped tight and
  recentered at a consistent scale on the theme's own card beige
  (#ece7dc, matching .montibello-product-range__image-wrap's background),
  so cards are visually uniform regardless of source photo quality. When
  `card_image` is blank (no derived asset made for that product yet), this
  falls back to `card_product.featured_image` unchanged — one reusable
  system, no per-page hacks, PDP hero/media is untouched either way.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% liquid
  assign card_product = all_products[block.settings.product_handle]
  assign card_subtitle = card_product.metafields.montibello.functional_subtitle.value
  assign card_sizes = ''
  if card_product != blank
    for variant in card_product.variants
      if variant.title != 'Default Title' and variant.title != blank
        if card_sizes == ''
          assign card_sizes = variant.title
        else
          assign card_sizes = card_sizes | append: ' / ' | append: variant.title
        endif
      endif
    endfor
  endif
%}
{%- comment -%}
  FULL-SITE PARITY: products that carry an `official_gallery` (the three active
  HOP families) render the official card — the white packshot canvas
  (the official product-card image, official-card-<handle>.webp), family eyebrow, product name without the "HOP" prefix,
  one-line subtitle and size pills — instead of the beige derived card.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% liquid
  assign official_canvas = blank
  assign official_raw = card_product.metafields.montibello.official_gallery.value
  if official_raw != blank or block.settings.card_image == 'official'
    assign official_canvas = 'official-card-' | append: card_product.handle | append: '.webp'
  endif
  assign card_range = card_product.metafields.montibello.range.value
  if card_range == 'HOP'
    assign card_eyebrow = card_product.metafields.montibello.subfamily.value | replace: 'Color Last', 'Colour Last'
  else
    assign card_eyebrow = card_range | downcase | capitalize
  endif
  assign card_name = card_product.title | remove_first: 'HOP '
%}
<a
  href="{{ card_product.url | default: '#' }}"
  class="montibello-product-range__card{% if official_canvas != blank %} montibello-product-range__card--official{% endif %}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="montibello-product-range__image-wrap">
    {%- if card_range == 'LUXLIGHT' and official_canvas != blank -%}<span class="montibello-nuevo-badge">nuevo</span>{%- endif -%}
    {% if official_canvas != blank %}
      <img
        src="{{ official_canvas | asset_url }}"
        alt="{{ card_product.title | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        class="montibello-product-range__image"
        width="900"
        height="1242"
      >
    {% elsif block.settings.card_image != blank %}
      <img
        src="{{ block.settings.card_image | asset_url }}"
        alt="{{ card_product.title | default: block.settings.fallback_title | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        class="montibello-product-range__image"
        width="1200"
        height="1600"
      >
    {% elsif card_product.featured_image != blank %}
      {{
        card_product.featured_image
        | image_url: width: 600
        | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'montibello-product-range__image', widths: '300,450,600'
      }}
    {% else %}
      <div class="montibello-product-range__image-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% if official_canvas != blank %}
    <p class="montibello-product-range__eyebrow">{{ card_eyebrow }}</p>
    <p class="montibello-product-range__name">{{ card_name }}</p>
    {% if card_subtitle != blank %}
      <p class="montibello-product-range__type">{{ card_subtitle }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    {% render 'montibello-card-pills', product: card_product, prefix: 'montibello-product-range' %}
  {% else %}
    <p class="montibello-product-range__name">{{ card_product.title | default: block.settings.fallback_title }}</p>
    {% if card_subtitle != blank %}
      <p class="montibello-product-range__type">{{ card_subtitle }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    {% if card_sizes != blank %}
      <p class="montibello-product-range__sizes">{{ card_sizes }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}
</a>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Tarjeta de producto",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "product_handle",
      "label": "Handle del producto"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "card_image",
      "label": "Imagen de tarjeta normalizada (assets/, opcional)",
      "info": "Nombre de archivo en /assets. Si está vacío, usa la imagen destacada del producto."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "fallback_title",
      "label": "Título alternativo"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
